{"4294930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unbelievers", "steam_appid": 4294930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4809020], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294930/extras/5d32e3aa7a08b15dce2e6f77ffca9db5.avif?t=1781553516\" width=820 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Unbelievers, time is broken—and so is the world you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 1986, you play as Rick, a hardened survivor who stumbles upon a mysterious box linked to the year 1919. When the box is opened, it tears a rift in time, dragging you into a decaying alternate past where reality is twisted, and nightmarish creatures rule the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with era-specific firearms and sheer determination, Rick must navigate through haunted ruins, desolate villages, and forgotten bunkers in a desperate bid to survive. Uncover the origins of the artifact, piece together a century-old conspiracy, and confront a darkness that feeds on fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a fight for survival—it's a battle to reclaim your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Twisting Narrative: Experience a story that shifts between 1986 and an alternate version of 1919, filled with mystery, horror, and dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense FPS Combat: Use a variety of classic firearms to fight back against grotesque, otherworldly creatures. Every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror: Explore eerie environments soaked in dread—abandoned buildings, fog-laden forests, and war-torn ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Exploration: Discover notes, relics, and environmental clues to unravel the truth behind the box and the creatures it unleashed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Sound Design: A haunting soundtrack and dynamic audio design bring the world to life—and death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what lies beneath history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbelievers — Coming Soon. Wishlist now and prepare to cross the rift.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294930/extras/5d32e3aa7a08b15dce2e6f77ffca9db5.avif?t=1781553516\" width=820 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Unbelievers, time is broken—and so is the world you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 1986, you play as Rick, a hardened survivor who stumbles upon a mysterious box linked to the year 1919. When the box is opened, it tears a rift in time, dragging you into a decaying alternate past where reality is twisted, and nightmarish creatures rule the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with era-specific firearms and sheer determination, Rick must navigate through haunted ruins, desolate villages, and forgotten bunkers in a desperate bid to survive. Uncover the origins of the artifact, piece together a century-old conspiracy, and confront a darkness that feeds on fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a fight for survival—it's a battle to reclaim your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Twisting Narrative: Experience a story that shifts between 1986 and an alternate version of 1919, filled with mystery, horror, and dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense FPS Combat: Use a variety of classic firearms to fight back against grotesque, otherworldly creatures. Every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Horror: Explore eerie environments soaked in dread—abandoned buildings, fog-laden forests, and war-torn ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Exploration: Discover notes, relics, and environmental clues to unravel the truth behind the box and the creatures it unleashed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Sound Design: A haunting soundtrack and dynamic audio design bring the world to life—and death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face what lies beneath history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbelievers — Coming Soon. Wishlist now and prepare to cross the rift.</p>", "short_description": "A psychological horror FPS where time fractures between 1986 and an alternate 1919. Fight nightmarish creatures, uncover a dark conspiracy, and struggle to reclaim your place in time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294930/58fb176516e8d256a6fb89663ca74b1da2b699bc/header.jpg?t=1781553516", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294930/8672542df9f1f4dd9126e06e16c1cbb2a5f5f894/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781553516", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294930/8672542df9f1f4dd9126e06e16c1cbb2a5f5f894/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781553516", "website": "http://2dotgames.com/games/unbelievers", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-9100F or Ryzen 3 2200G or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>