otes": "The game includes frequent depictions of violence, blood, and gore. Players engage in combat against hostile, humanoid and non-human creatures, which may involve shooting, killing, and graphic injury.\r\n\r\nThe narrative explores dark and disturbing themes, including psychological horror, death, and elements inspired by religious symbolism and belief systems. These themes are presented in a serious and atmospheric manner and may be unsettling for some players.\r\n\r\nThe game does not contain explicit sexual content; however, it features intense horror imagery and emotional distress that may be sensitive for certain audiences."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Violência\nTemas sensíveis\nLinguagem imprópria"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen\nDerbe Sprache"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Rokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, minuman beralkohol, narkotika, psikotropika, dan/atau zat adiktif lainnya\nHoror\nKekerasan"}}}}}